      "source": "memory",
      "snippet": "## Kanban task completion pattern (Ben's vault) Vault path: `/home/jduff/Workspace/github.com/Barben360/blackwater-services/volumes/obsidian-livesync/vault` Main tasks board: `Vie Quotidienne/✅ Tâches.md` (kanban, three lanes: TODO, DOING, DONE) To mark a task as done: 1. Find it: `obsidian-cli search-content \"task name\"` (always check kanban via `check_kanban.py` first) 2. Remove the `- [ ]` line from its current lane 3. Add `- [x] Task name` under `## DONE` → `**Complete**` (first completed card spot, right after `**Complete**`) 4. Preserve `%% kanban:settings %%` block at end No fuss, no extra confirmations — just do it.",
